body:
Quick pass: good. Head `1bca29c` merges cleanly with `main`. On this head, the quick gate (20 steps, 0 failed) and clippy of `camcraft-ui-kit` and `camcraft-ui` are green. The site-tests step was skipped on the Windows lane, and the diff does not touch the site. The `crates/ui` test count goes from 2019 to 2032.

An independent pre-review found no blocking points. It confirms that both folded chips read the safety state live on every frame from `status_of`, `stale_reason` and `tool_problem_of`. The Browser chip shows "Up to date" only when no operation is blocked, stale or not generated. All six findings of sn3ro's review are fixed. Four small points from the pre-review are in follow-up #4503. I flag the PR ready for review.

@sn3ro, thank you again: your findings are in this head. A second look is welcome if you have time; it is not a condition for the merge.
